# Line endings are LF everywhere: in the repository AND in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every file
# to CRLF, and git then reports files as modified when nothing in them changed.
# `eol=lf` overrides that setting for this repository, so the sources match what
# the Linux container runs and what oxfmt writes (endOfLine: "lf").
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binaries. `text=auto` already detects them, but being explicit
# means a corrupted image can never be blamed on line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
